[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2716014161","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103918#issuecomment-2716014161","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103918","id":2716014161,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6h4xZR","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-12T00:12:09Z","updated_at":"2025-03-12T00:12:09Z","body":"After digging with @darksylinc , I'm leaning towards this not being a Godot issue. I was not able to reproduce it with the llvm 19.1.7 distributed on their official GitHub. But I can with llvm 19.1.7 distributed with zig.\n\nAs @darksylinc correctly pointed out, the act of not reproducing does not mean it isn't a Godot issue. If it's a race condition, it absolutely still could be on the Godot side. Just how 19.1.7 is configured by the zig team causes it to appear more frequently.\n\nAll that to give an update that I don't currently think it's on the Godot side. So don't push through this PR yet. I'll confirm soon.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2716014161/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2719663435","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103918#issuecomment-2719663435","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103918","id":2719663435,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iGsVL","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-13T02:46:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T02:46:27Z","body":"Fixed over on the zig repo: https://github.com/ziglang/zig/pull/23227\n\nIt is actually an issue with glibc.  We opened a ticket with them.  So note that if someone compiles godot against glibc 2.41 and then ships it to other linux systems, a nasty bug will occur that breaks threading and causes threads to hang.  Reported here:\n\nhttps://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32786\n\nI guess @AThousandShips, is this something godot would want to worry about documenting?  I personally don't think its something Godot needs to worry about... unless of course there are a lot of devs building godot from source against glibc 2.41 and are going to be confused when their game keeps freezing on client machines...\n\nI'll leave this open to discuss that.  But just know that it is solved at least for my end and if you are happy with this solution, we can close the issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2719663435/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2720279723","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103918#issuecomment-2720279723","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103918","id":2720279723,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iJCyr","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-13T07:53:54Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T07:53:54Z","body":"Good work tracking this!\n\nThe glibc fix seems to be included in 2.42 and back ported for the 2.41 stable branch. It seems like a lot more applications than just Godot would be affected so hopefully Linux distros pick it up and make sure they glibc is up to date with the stable branch if they ship with 2.41.\n\nI'll keep a mental note of it for official builds, but it will be years until we reach this kind of glibc number (we compile against the oldest glibc we want to support) so by that time it should be fine.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2720279723/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2720773675","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103918#issuecomment-2720773675","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103918","id":2720773675,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iK7Yr","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-13T10:37:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T10:37:23Z","body":"@akien-mga A quick google search indicates your presumption is correct! \n\nhttps://www.gamingonlinux.com/2025/02/the-glibc-2-41-update-has-been-causing-problems-for-linux-gaming/\n\nHopefully this is the reason so many games broke and hopefully people can get back to playing their games soon! :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2720773675/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]